52fitemswapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemSwapper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsaddon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JobsAddon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Leveling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/language-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moving-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moving Elevators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmusic-notification\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Music Notification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-nether-chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Chested [Forge & Fabric]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-chat-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoChatReports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paladin's Furniture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funiversal-sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sawmill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-uncrafting-table-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Uncrafting Table</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Voice Chat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TrashSlot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Useful Backpacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Notebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yyz's backpack</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Ссылки</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Условия использования</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>Copyright © Unique Dark</p><p>Автор: AmongstReality</p><p>Ссылки на страницы автора на разных платформах:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></li><li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" rel=\"nofollow\">BuyMeACoffee</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li><li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li><li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></li></ul><p>Когда можно использовать мои материалы:</p><ul><li>В публичных модпаках на Modrinth/CurseForge.</li><li>Если вы хотите добавить поддержку мода в качестве аддона к ресурс-паку. В этом случае необходимо указать чёткое авторство со ссылками на оригинальный ресурс-пак.</li><li>В любых частных модификациях оригинального ресурс-пака.</li></ul><p>Когда <strong>НЕЛЬЗЯ</strong> использовать мои материалы:</p><ul><li>Распространение через Bedrock Marketplace.</li><li>Помещение контента за платный доступ (например, Patreon).</li><li>Распространение оригинальных или изменённых материалов на любых платформах.</li></ul><p>Ссылки на страницы ресурс-пака на различных платформах:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li><li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li></ul></div>",
